---
const COLORS = [
  ['Mocha', '#8b7561'],
  ['Cokelat Hangat', '#8b5e3c'],
  ['Hijau Sage', '#58765d'],
  ['Biru Dusty', '#4a6785'],
  ['Rosewood', '#9f5262'],
  ['Charcoal', '#493d35'],
  ['Emas Antik', '#9a7a38'],
];

const PATTERNS = [
  ['none', 'Tanpa pola'],
  ['floral', 'Bunga'],
  ['leaf', 'Daun'],
  ['kawung', 'Kawung'],
  ['dots', 'Titik'],
  ['waves', 'Gelombang'],
];
---
<div class="space-y-6">
  <div>
    <label for="f-theme-color" class="block text-sm font-medium text-[#493D35]">Warna utama undangan</label>
    <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <input id="f-theme-color" type="color" data-bind="theme.primaryColor"
        class="h-9 w-12 cursor-pointer rounded-[8px] border border-[#D8C8B5] bg-[#FFFFFF] p-0.5" />
      {COLORS.map(([name, value]) => (
        <button type="button" data-color-preset={value} title={name} aria-label={name}
          class="h-7 w-7 rounded-[6px] border border-[#D8C8B5] transition-transform hover:scale-105"
          style={`background:${value}`}></button>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#6C5E54]">
      Dipakai untuk judul, aksen garis, tombol, dan pola. Warna terlalu terang ditolak agar teks putih tetap terbaca.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#A34E4E]" data-error-for="theme.primaryColor"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-[#D8C8B5] pt-5">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#493D35]">Pola latar</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
      {PATTERNS.map(([kind, label]) => (
        <button type="button" data-pattern-pick={kind} title={label} aria-label={label}
          class="flex h-14 flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-[8px] border border-[#D8C8B5] bg-[#F5F0E8]/60 p-1">
          {kind === 'none' ? (
            <span class="text-xs text-[#6C5E54]">Polos</span>
          ) : (
            <span class="pattern-preview" data-pattern-kind={kind}></span>
          )}
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="f-pattern-opacity" class="block text-xs text-[#6C5E54]">Ketebalan pola</label>
      <input id="f-pattern-opacity" type="range" min="5" max="40" step="1"
        data-bind="theme.pattern.opacity" data-type="number" class="mt-1 w-full accent-[#8B7561]" />
      <p class="text-xs text-[#A34E4E]" data-error-for="theme.pattern.opacity"></p>
    </div>

    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#493D35]">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="theme.pattern.all" class="accent-[#8B7561]" />
      Terapkan ke semua section
    </label>
    <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#6C5E54]">
      Bila dimatikan, aktifkan pola secara manual melalui &ldquo;Gaya section&rdquo; di tiap bagian.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xs text-[#A34E4E]" data-error-for="theme.pattern.kind"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-2.5 border-t border-[#D8C8B5] pt-5">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#493D35]">Animasi transisi</p>
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#493D35]">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="theme.animation.enabled" class="accent-[#8B7561]" />
      Aktifkan efek fade-in saat digulir
    </label>
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#493D35]">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="theme.animation.all" class="accent-[#8B7561]" />
      Terapkan ke semua section
    </label>
    <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#6C5E54]">
      Animasi otomatis dinonaktifkan bagi pengunjung yang mengaktifkan opsi pengurangan gerak di perangkatnya.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>